### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8082/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Sharma",
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "password": "DemoPass456"
}

### Login with valid credentials
POST http://localhost:8082/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "password": "DemoPass456"
}

### Login with invalid credentials (expects 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### Retrieve all users (passwords must NOT be returned)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users
